+// Modified for t2d-no-fate-vita (2026): virtual calls through merged class pointers, string indexer, gaps always marked, inlined object hash, small structs as numbers, floating-point negation, merged struct returns, low halves of 64-bit fields, casts of stored objects, unboxed reads after a type test, a class entry's address merged from several paths. See NOTICE.md in that project's tools/rewind/patches.
